---
import PageShell from '../layouts/PageShell.astro';
---

<PageShell
	title="About — WebRaiser"
	description="Learn about WebRaiser's approach to building thoughtful digital experiences for modern businesses."
>
	<section class="page-intro shell" aria-labelledby="page-title">
		<p class="eyebrow">A little about us</p>
		<h1 id="page-title">Small details.<br /><em>Lasting impression.</em></h1>
		<p>WebRaiser is a web development studio focused on thoughtful websites and useful digital experiences for modern businesses.</p>
	</section>

	<section class="about-section page-about-section" aria-labelledby="about-title">
		<div class="shell about-inner">
			<div class="about-mark" aria-hidden="true">
				<span>W</span><i></i><i></i>
			</div>
			<div class="about-copy">
				<p class="eyebrow">Our point of view</p>
				<h2 id="about-title">Make the web<br /><em>feel more useful.</em></h2>
				<p>We bring careful design and considered development together to make websites that feel clear, distinctive and genuinely useful.</p>
				<p>Our work spans custom website development and early template concepts. Each project begins by understanding what it needs to do, then shaping an appropriate direction.</p>
			</div>
		</div>
	</section>

	<section class="section shell about-principles" aria-labelledby="principles-title">
		<div class="section-heading">
			<div>
				<p class="eyebrow">How we think</p>
				<h2 id="principles-title">A considered<br /><em>way of working.</em></h2>
			</div>
			<p class="section-intro">No claims about size or history—just a clear intent behind the work.</p>
		</div>
		<div class="principles-grid">
			<article><span>01</span><h3>Start with clarity</h3><p>Understand the audience and purpose before adding complexity.</p></article>
			<article><span>02</span><h3>Design with care</h3><p>Give content, hierarchy and detail the attention they deserve.</p></article>
			<article><span>03</span><h3>Build for use</h3><p>Make responsive, accessible experiences that are straightforward to navigate.</p></article>
		</div>
	</section>

	<section class="page-bottom-cta">
		<div class="shell page-bottom-cta-inner">
			<div>
				<p class="eyebrow eyebrow-light">Make the next step</p>
				<h2>Have something<br /><em>good in mind?</em></h2>
			</div>
			<a class="button button-light" href="/contact">Get in touch <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a>
		</div>
	</section>
</PageShell>
